{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"tcl","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Tcl","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Tcl (.tcl .tk).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"tcl","name":"Tcl","extensions":[".tcl",".tk"],"grammar":"grammars/tcl.json","lineComment":"#"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Tcl","path":"snippets/tcl.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/tcl.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$\\\\{?[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_:]*\\\\}?\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:namespace|continue|lreplace|variable|foreach|lappend|linsert|llength|lsearch|package|uplevel|append|concat|elseif|format|global|lindex|lrange|regexp|regsub|rename|return|string|switch|after|array|break|catch|close|lsort|split|subst|trace|unset|upvar|vwait|while|else|eval|exec|exit|expr|gets|incr|info|join|list|lset|open|proc|puts|read|scan|then|time|for|set|cd|if)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/tcl.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Proc\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"proc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"proc ${1:name} {${2:args}} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A procedure\"\n  },\n  \"Foreach\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fe\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"foreach ${1:item} ${2:\\\\$list} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"foreach\"\n  },\n  \"If\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"if\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"if {${1:condition}} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"if\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Tcl\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Tcl.\n\n## Files\n\n`.tcl`, `.tk`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `proc` | A procedure |\n| `fe` | foreach |\n| `if` | if |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}